3.1 project.yml（XcodeGen 配置）

```yaml
name: FrameInterpolation
options:
  bundleIdPrefix: com.yourname
  deploymentTarget:
    iOS: "16.0"
  createIntermediateGroups: true

settings:
  base:
    SWIFT_VERSION: "5.9"
    DEVELOPMENT_TEAM: ""
    CODE_SIGN_STYLE: Manual
    CODE_SIGNING_REQUIRED: NO
    CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED: NO

targets:
  FrameInterpolation:
    type: application
    platform: iOS
    sources:
      - path: FrameInterpolation
    info:
      path: FrameInterpolation/Resources/Info.plist
      properties:
        CFBundleDisplayName: 补帧
        CFBundleShortVersionString: "1.0.0"
        CFBundleVersion: "1"
        UILaunchScreen:
          UIColorName: BgPrimary
        UISupportedInterfaceOrientations:
          - UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait
        NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription: 需要访问相册以导入和保存视频
        NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription: 需要保存补帧后的视频到相册
        NSMicrophoneUsageDescription: 处理视频时不需要麦克风权限
    settings:
      base:
        PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER: com.yourname.frameinterpolation
        ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME: AppIcon
        ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_GLOBAL_ACCENT_COLOR_NAME: AccentColor
```

bundleIdPrefix 和 PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER 改成你自己的，AltStore 侧载时 Bundle ID 必须唯一。

